<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McDonald's EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McDonald's EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut its 1996 share earnings estimate on McDonald's Corp to $2.22 from $2.25 and 1997's to $2.55 from $2.60. It still rates the stock a market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 46-3/4, off its day's high of 47-1/8.</p>
